r of the New York Times bestseller Feel-Good Productivity. On this channel, we explore the skills th..."><meta name="keywords" content="productivity &quot;self improvement&quot; &quot;personal development&quot; &quot;build a life you love&quot; &quot;ali abdaal&quot; &quot;ali abdal&quot; &quot;lifestyle business&quot; &quot;lifestyle business academy&quot; sup..."><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="RSS" href="https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg"><meta property="og:title" content="Ali Abdaal"><link rel="image_src" href="https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_m2xx6mCZwsyjARnkwBKJxEv0FqGxGS2NwWNkjWH__Smw=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj"><meta property="og:site_name" content="YouTube"><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg"><meta property="og:image" content="https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_m2xx6mCZwsyjARnkwBKJxEv0FqGxGS2NwWNkjWH__Smw=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj"><meta property="og:image:width" content="900"><meta property="og:image:height" content="900"><meta property="og:description" content="I'm Ali - doctor turned entrepreneur, YouTuber, and author of the New York Times bestseller Feel-Good Productivity. 

On this channel, we explore the skills that school didn't teach you - productivity, personal development, how to become financially free, how to build your own independent business. These are the skills I learned through trial-and-error while trying to build my own business alongside medical school at Cambridge University. After years of trying, learning and making mistakes, I ended up in a life I could never have imagined. On this YouTube channel, I try my best to share everything I've learned (and that I'm continuing to learn) along the way :) 

The channel's been active since 2017, when I first started vlogging my life as a medical student and sharing study tips. Since then, I graduated, became a doctor, worked full-time in the UK's NHS (including during COVID), started a business, grew it to 7-figures, wrote a book, got married and had a baby girl :)
