dependent business. These are the skills I learned through trial-and-error while trying to build my own business alongside medical school at Cambridge University. After years of trying, learning and making mistakes, I ended up in a life I could never have imagined. On this YouTube channel, I try my best to share everything I've learned (and that I'm continuing to learn) along the way :) \n\nThe channel's been active since 2017, when I first started vlogging my life as a medical student and sharing study tips. Since then, I graduated, became a doctor, worked full-time in the UK's NHS (including during COVID), started a business, grew it to 7-figures, wrote a book, got married and had a baby girl :)\n","rssUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg","channelConversionUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/pagead/viewthroughconversion/962985656/?backend=innertube\u0026cname=1\u0026cver=2_20260916_01_00\u0026data=backend%3Dinnertube%3Bcname%3D1%3Bcver%3D2_20260916_01_00%3Bptype%3Dcview%3Btype%3Dcview%3Butuid%3DoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg\u0026foc_id=oOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg\u0026label=followon_cvisit\u0026ptype=cview\u0026utuid=oOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg","externalId":"UCoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg","keywords":"productivity \"self improvement\" \"personal development\" \"build a life you love\" \"ali abdaal\" \"ali abdal\" \"lifestyle business\" \"lifestyle business academy\" superfocus ptya \"feel good productivity\" \"feel-good productivity\"","ownerUrls":["http://www.youtube.com/@aliabdaal"],"avatar":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/AIdro_m2xx6mCZwsyjARnkwBKJxEv0FqGxGS2NwWNkjWH__Smw=s900-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","width":900,"height":900}]},"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoOae5nYA7VqaXzerajD0lg","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountryCodes":["KH","AD","LY","PS","BG","TC","MF","BS","MU","FI","MX","BD","LS","GE","AZ","AO","HU","LV","PF","PH","GR","IT","IM","LU","TF","VN","GN","BE","SR","DM","NO","IN","RE","SJ","KZ",